OL,3,GNEWSAVaping rates for schoolchildren
OL,4,Aappear to drop - is it falling out of
OL,5,Afavour?
OL,6,
OL,7,FFor the first time in several years,
OL,8,Fthe rates of vaping among
OL,9,Fschoolchildren in Wales appear to be
OL,10,Ffalling.
OL,12,FThe most recent data from a survey of
OL,13,Fmore than 130,000 young people in
OL,14,Fsecondary schools showed that across
OL,15,Fall age groups, habits are changing for
OL,16,Fboth vaping and smoking.
OL,18,FPublic health officials say the
OL,19,F"significant fall" since 2023 coincides
OL,20,Fwith the ban on disposable vapes being
OL,21,Fannounced, though the impact of the law
OL,22,Fchange is still being evaluated.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
